# Fixture: local-playing. The pass-2 states, photographed.
#
# Overflow menus, cluster collapse, and the phone Listen segment are pure
# presentation, and `act` has no label for them yet (the vocabulary lives in
# desktop/src/scenario.rs, which this lane does not own). So the controls are
# reached by `pointer-click` at coordinates read off a 960x640 receipt. When
# the scenario lane adds `menu:`, `cluster:` and `pane:` labels these become
# named acts and the coordinates go away.
settle 30
act tab:listen
settle 10
capture listen-menus-shut

# The queue row's overflow trigger, right of the LOCAL badge.
pointer-click 338 117
settle 10
capture listen-menu-open
pointer-click 338 117
settle 5

# A note row's trigger: one menu at a time, so this one takes it.
pointer-click 916 114
settle 10
capture note-menu-open
pointer-click 916 114
settle 5

act tab:notes
settle 15
capture notes-cluster-open
# The cluster header's collapse link.
pointer-click 265 211
settle 10
capture notes-cluster-collapsed
pointer-click 262 211
settle 10

act tab:mere
settle 15
capture mere-unpinned
# The connections card's Pin, which is a real model toggle now.
pointer-click 90 309
settle 10
capture mere-pinned
log design_completions complete
